  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "EPISODE XXI THE CELESTIAL CASINO\n\nIt is a period of high stakes. In
    the lawless territories of the outer rim, brave travelers and reckless smugglers
    gather at a legendary sanctuary: THE CELESTIAL CASINO. Here, fortunes are forged
    and shattered upon the green felt tables of destiny.\n\nYour mission is clear,
    but fraught with peril. You must face the relentless Dealer in the ancient galactic
    rite known as BLACKJACK. The objective is absolute: assemble a hand whose total
    power eclipses the Dealer's, without crossing the fatal threshold of twenty-one.\n\nKnow
    your arsenal. Standard cards hold their numerical value, while the royal faces\u2014Jacks,
    Queens, and Kings\u2014command the power of ten. The elusive Ace acts as a dual
    force, bending to your will as either a one or an eleven to shield you from destruction.\n\nWhen
    the initial cards are dealt, you must choose your path. Command a HIT to draw
    another card from the infinite deck, or STAND to hold your ground and face your
    fate. If you sense a swift victory, execute a DOUBLE DOWN, committing twice your
    credits for one final, decisive strike.\n\nBut beware the BUST. Should your total
    exceed twenty-one, your credits will be swept into the dark abyss. The Dealer
    stands ready. May the cards be with you..."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 2180264, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
